WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.567
-After more classified documents
were found

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:04.901
at the homes of President Biden

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:06.367
and former
Vice President Mike Pence,

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.067
Donald Trump's supporters
in the GOP

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.734
and on Fox News claimed Trump
had been vindicated,

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:11.801
while also spreading

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.734
wild conspiracy theories
about the news.

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:15.501
But, if anything,
the cases of Biden and Pence

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:16.968
make Trump's potentially

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.400
criminal behavior
look a lot worse.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.334
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:24.501
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.667
Trump supporters in the GOP
and on Fox News

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.167
have been twisting themselves
in knots

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.400
over the revelations
about classified documents found

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.234
at the homes of Trump,
Biden, and Pence.

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:34.234
For example,
when the news first broke

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.200
that the FBI had searched
Mar-a-Lago last year

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.067
and discovered
top secret documents

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.267
that Trump had lied about having
and refused to give back,

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:41.701
you might recall
that many Republicans

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.567
dismissed it as a nonscandal.

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.434
They threw out every excuse
they could think of --

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:47.033
it was a storage issue,

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:49.200
the FBI was just fishing,
they planted evidence,

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.501
or even that Trump
was just a little sloppy

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.334
because he didn't have time
to pack.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:54.567
-This is really, at its core,

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.767
a storage argument.

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:59.133
I don't think a fight
over storage of documents

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.000
is worthy of what they've done.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.501
-This was a fishing expedition.

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.934
It was an old-fashioned,
fake fishing expedition.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:07.067
I actually think it had little
to nothing

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.567
to do with classified documents.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:12.067
-No one trusts the FBI
or the DOJ anymore.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.734
I don't trust them any further
than I can throw

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:14.934
that entire building.

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.334
If they told me
that they found something,

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:18.467
I wouldn't know that they
actually found it there

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:20.234
or if they just said
they found it there.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:22.934
-Who is to say,
in this kind of case,

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.868
that some of the documents
supposedly seized

00:01:25.868 --> 00:01:27.868
were not planted there,
to begin with?

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:30.033
-Do I know that the boxes
of material

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.501
they took from Mar-a-Lago,

00:01:31.501 --> 00:01:34.400
that they won't put things
in those boxes to entrap him?

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.701
How do we know that they're
going to be honest with us

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.234
about what's actually
in the boxes?

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.434
-When the president moves
out of the White House,

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:40.634
you have effectively, you know,

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:42.033
six hours to move
out of the White House.

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.100
It's effectively
inauguration time

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.534
where one president
gets moved out

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:46.934
and one president gets moved in.

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:48.601
-No, you don't have six hours!

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:49.868
You have two months!

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:50.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:51.934
But, unfortunately, your dad

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.701
spent those two months bitching
and moaning

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:55.267
and planning a coup
to stay in power.

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:56.567
And then,
when it didn't work out

00:01:56.567 --> 00:01:58.167
and the moving van showed up,
he just screamed --

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.934
[ As Trump ] Oh, [bleep],
grab everything and run!

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:01.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.400
Your dad was the first president
to leave office

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.934
like a looter at Best Buy
during a blackout.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.868
[ Laughter and applause ]
You guys are acting

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:10.634
like the inauguration
is a surprise party

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:13.000
where they keep the date secret
until the last minute.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.868
[ Laughter ]
I don't remember
Joe Biden walking

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.467
into the Capitol,
flicking the lights on,

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:17.968
and seeing thousands
of people assembled.

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:19.601
[ As Biden ]
Whoa!

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:21.167
[ Laughter ]
What the hell is this?!

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:24.534
Although, it is ve...ry hard
to surprise Joe Biden.

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:26.567
He is always on alert.

00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:28.067
That's why he tiptoes
into every room,

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:29.868
like someone about to pop out

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:32.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
from behind a couch

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.234
and he freezes every time
he hears a noise.

00:02:34.234 --> 00:02:37.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:41.100
[ As Biden ]
You here, Aunt Cathy?

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:41.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:43.300
I can hear you breathing.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:47.033
Then there was also
the ridiculous excuse

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.133
that Trump is just
a nostalgic guy

00:02:49.133 --> 00:02:52.267
who loves to save little
mementos and keepsakes.

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:53.868
-My father-in-law,
as anybody knows,

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:56.267
who's been around him a lot,
loves to save things,

00:02:56.267 --> 00:03:00.067
like newspaper clippings,
magazine clippings, photographs.

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:02.801
-My father always
kept clippings.

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:03.934
You know, press clippings.

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:05.467
He would have, you know,
newspaper articles,

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:07.133
pictures, notes from us.

00:03:07.133 --> 00:03:08.834
-[ As Eric ]
He saves every note
I've ever given him.

00:03:08.834 --> 00:03:11.234
In fact, he has a special
storage bin where he puts them.

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.234
He showed it to me.

00:03:12.234 --> 00:03:14.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:16.300
Actually, I think I know
where Trump puts notes

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.434
from his weird adult sons.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:18.767
I'm not going to say where,

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:21.000
but it would explain why
he's always talking about this.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.334
-People are flushing toilets

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
10 times, 15 times,

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:25.968
as opposed to once.

00:03:25.968 --> 00:03:27.868
-[ As Trump ]
You got to flush 15 times,

00:03:27.868 --> 00:03:29.067
otherwise, you'll never get rid

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:31.167
of that big stack
of Father Day cards.

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:33.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:33.634 --> 00:03:36.000
So, those were all the excuses
Trump supporters offered

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.400
when Trump got caught
with hundreds

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.434
of classified documents
that he lied about

00:03:39.434 --> 00:03:41.968
and refused, for over a year,
to turn over,

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:43.834
despite multiple requests
and a subpoena.

00:03:43.834 --> 00:03:46.334
But then, when Biden found
and voluntarily turned over

00:03:46.334 --> 00:03:48.133
a much smaller cache
of documents

00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:49.968
from his time as a senator
and vice president,

00:03:49.968 --> 00:03:51.634
Republicans suddenly changed
their tune

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:53.534
and claimed it was
a national security emergency

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:55.601
because, unlike Trump,
Biden supposedly did not have

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.300
the power to declassify
documents.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:00.467
-The president has the authority
to declassify a document.

00:04:00.467 --> 00:04:02.734
Now, the question is whether
or not the president

00:04:02.734 --> 00:04:04.767
actually declassified
the documents.

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:08.334
The vice president does not have
the authority to declassify.

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:09.868
-President Trump, as president,

00:04:09.868 --> 00:04:12.200
has the right
to declassify documents,

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.133
so, the media should
cover the fact

00:04:14.133 --> 00:04:18.400
that the FBI has been weaponized
against President Trump

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:23.100
and, clearly, has covered up
for sitting president Joe Biden.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:26.400
-Let's be very clear -- like we
said, from the beginning,

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:28.901
a former vice president,
or anybody else,

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:32.133
has no ability to remove
classified documents.

00:04:32.133 --> 00:04:34.400
Former presidents are different.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.767
-Joe Biden conceivably
stole those documents.

00:04:37.767 --> 00:04:39.100
What people need
to understand is

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.133
the president
of the United States

00:04:41.133 --> 00:04:44.200
is the only one that can
declassify documents,

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.701
not the vice president.

00:04:45.701 --> 00:04:47.801
-Right.
-For Joe Biden
to steal documents

00:04:47.801 --> 00:04:51.367
and have possession of them,
this is a serious investigation.

00:04:51.367 --> 00:04:52.400
-[ As Greene ]
This is very serious

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.601
and that's why I'm calling
on QAnon

00:04:54.601 --> 00:04:57.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
and the Jewish space laser
to step in and investigate

00:04:57.467 --> 00:05:00.100
and it should be easy
to track everyone's movements

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:03.367
using the microchip Bill Gates
planted in the COVID vaccine.

00:05:03.367 --> 00:05:05.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:05.467 --> 00:05:07.100
Which I appreciate he did, now.

00:05:08.367 --> 00:05:11.000
[ Cheering ]
First of all,
that's flat-out wrong.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.234
Biden did have the power

00:05:12.234 --> 00:05:14.267
to declassify the documents
as vice president.

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:16.400
That doesn't mean he should've
had them in his home.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.400
He shouldn't have.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.934
Although, again,
as we stated before,

00:05:18.934 --> 00:05:20.834
it's not exactly surprising
to me

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:23.200
that Joe Biden didn't take
document security seriously

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.033
during his time
as Obama's vice president.

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:26.701
I mean, look at him.
That is...

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.767 --> 00:05:32.033
...definitely the face of a dude
who might take documents

00:05:32.033 --> 00:05:33.968
and who definitely has a bunch
of towels at home

00:05:33.968 --> 00:05:35.167
with hotel names on them.

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:36.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:36.767 --> 00:05:38.100
So, Trump supporters had
to pivot

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.667
when the documents were found
in Biden's home.

00:05:39.667 --> 00:05:41.701
Then they got thrown
for yet another loop

00:05:41.701 --> 00:05:43.567
when classified documents
were also found

00:05:43.567 --> 00:05:45.200
at the home of former
Vice President Mike Pence.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.667
Some Republicans responded
to the news

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:49.000
by just throwing their hands up
and saying, "Screw it."

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.100
Like Lindsey Graham, who,

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.434
instead of making
a political point,

00:05:51.434 --> 00:05:52.701
decided to just make a joke.

00:05:52.701 --> 00:05:55.200
-You got Trump, you got Pence,
you got Biden.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.100
The only thing I think
you'll find at my house is

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.501
a bunch of Chick-fil-A bags
on the floor.

00:05:59.501 --> 00:06:01.834
[ Laughter ]
-Okay. But in fairness,
there's a good chance

00:06:01.834 --> 00:06:03.834
those were stolen from the
Trump White House, too.

00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:07.300
[ Laughter ]
It would not surprise me
if Trump wrote "Classified"

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.601
on every fast food box
that came through there.

00:06:09.601 --> 00:06:12.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
Other Trump supporters, however,
tried to thread the needle

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.400
by claiming Trump and Pence
were innocent,

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.901
but Biden was, somehow, guilty,
like Ted Cruz, who called

00:06:16.901 --> 00:06:19.334
the FBI search of Mar-a-Lago
a fishing expedition.

00:06:19.334 --> 00:06:22.634
Cruz demanded more FBI searches
of Biden and his family,

00:06:22.634 --> 00:06:25.334
while also dismissing
the Pence news as no big deal.

00:06:25.334 --> 00:06:27.200
-I believe the FBI needs

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:30.367
to search the residences
of Hunter Biden

00:06:30.367 --> 00:06:33.000
and any business offices
of Hunter Biden

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.601
to determine if there are
classified materials there.

00:06:35.601 --> 00:06:38.300
-Just as an addendum to this,
the news came out today --

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.701
I'm sure you saw it --

00:06:39.701 --> 00:06:42.133
that former
Vice President Mike Pence,

00:06:42.133 --> 00:06:43.667
a friend of both of ours,

00:06:43.667 --> 00:06:46.033
he's found
some classified documents,

00:06:46.033 --> 00:06:50.067
I think, at his home in Indiana,
not in his office.

00:06:50.067 --> 00:06:51.467
What do you make of that?

00:06:51.467 --> 00:06:54.534
-Oh, look, the Mike Pence story,
it's still early.

00:06:54.534 --> 00:06:55.968
You know, Mike Pence --
and, as you noted,

00:06:55.968 --> 00:06:58.267
he is a good friend,
he's a good man --

00:06:58.267 --> 00:07:01.234
he's explained
where these came from.

00:07:01.234 --> 00:07:04.067
That was a mistake,
but there's no reason

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:07.033
to think it was anything
but inadvertent.

00:07:07.033 --> 00:07:09.133
-Within a matter of seconds,
he went from saying

00:07:09.133 --> 00:07:11.334
the FBI should search
the president's son,

00:07:11.334 --> 00:07:12.734
who has no connection
to any of this,

00:07:12.734 --> 00:07:14.934
to brushing off the Pence news
as inadvertent.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.501
Why aren't you calling
on the FBI to search

00:07:16.501 --> 00:07:18.767
Mike Pence's other properties,
like his office

00:07:18.767 --> 00:07:20.901
or that happy place in his head
he goes to

00:07:20.901 --> 00:07:22.200
when he's in a meeting
with Donald Trump?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.767 --> 00:07:26.934
Other Fox hosts
tried other excuses,

00:07:26.934 --> 00:07:29.100
like claiming Pence's mistake
was understandable

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:32.400
because he didn't have much time
to leave the White House.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.000
-Biden says he was in a rush
to pack up his stuff

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.601
after his vice presidency.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.300
Wait a second.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.801
I think Mike Pence was

00:07:40.801 --> 00:07:43.534
in a little bit more of a rush.

00:07:43.534 --> 00:07:45.834
[ Laughing ]
Remember that transition?

00:07:45.834 --> 00:07:47.834
And Biden knew he was leaving
the White House.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.601
It had been eight years.

00:07:49.601 --> 00:07:52.033
You're not allowed
to stay any longer.

00:07:52.033 --> 00:07:54.100
Pence was looking
around, saying, "Wait,

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.667
is Trump going
to pull this off?"

00:07:55.667 --> 00:07:58.634
-Wait, you think Mike Pence,
known for, among other things,

00:07:58.634 --> 00:08:02.434
the January 6th rioters chanting
[ Laughing ] "Hang Mike Pence,"

00:08:02.434 --> 00:08:04.534
[ Laughter ]
didn't pack because he

00:08:04.534 --> 00:08:07.000
was waiting to see
if the coup would succeed?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.133
[ Laughter ]
[ As Pence ] If I spend all day
packing boxes

00:08:10.133 --> 00:08:11.567
and writing on them
with a Sharpie

00:08:11.567 --> 00:08:12.667
and then I get killed,

00:08:12.667 --> 00:08:14.901
I'm going to feel so stupid.

00:08:14.901 --> 00:08:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.901 --> 00:08:19.100
And we know Pence wasn't
in a rush to pack

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.133
because we've seen what he looks
like when he's in a rush.

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.501
He claps when he runs.

00:08:22.501 --> 00:08:24.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.767 --> 00:08:26.601
If Pence had been rushing
to pack up his office

00:08:26.601 --> 00:08:28.734
on the last day, you would've
heard this sound coming

00:08:28.734 --> 00:08:29.601
from the White House.

00:08:29.601 --> 00:08:31.400
[ Rhythmic clapping ]

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.033
[ Laughter ]
[ Rhythmic clapping ]

00:08:34.033 --> 00:08:36.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.901 --> 00:08:40.601
[ Clapping rhythmically ]

00:08:40.601 --> 00:08:43.300
[ Applause ]

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.300
[ As Trump ]
Mike, Mike, are you clapping?

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.434
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.434 --> 00:08:47.133
I just -- I want to --

00:08:47.133 --> 00:08:50.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:50.467 --> 00:08:51.934
And then,
after they made excuses,

00:08:51.934 --> 00:08:53.701
they moved on
to baseless speculation.

00:08:53.701 --> 00:08:55.734
For example, Fox host
Laura Ingraham wanted to know

00:08:55.734 --> 00:08:57.667
why the FBI hadn't searched

00:08:57.667 --> 00:08:59.734
President Obama's home
and office yet.

00:08:59.734 --> 00:09:02.000
-On the issue of Obama,
it is curious

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.734
why the DOJ hasn't
requested access

00:09:04.734 --> 00:09:06.601
to his many offices
across the country,

00:09:06.601 --> 00:09:08.200
given the fact that a majority

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.834
of Biden's documents came
from his administration.

00:09:11.834 --> 00:09:13.701
-I have no idea whether
any classified documents

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:14.834
will show up at his house,

00:09:14.834 --> 00:09:16.300
but if there's one person
I'm willing to bet

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.734
did things the right way,
it was Obama.

00:09:17.734 --> 00:09:19.767
Plus, let's not forget,
he left office

00:09:19.767 --> 00:09:22.234
and his life immediately
got way better.

00:09:22.234 --> 00:09:24.100
[ Laughter ]
He's not moping
around a country club,

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.701
stealing the mic at weddings
to bitch about witch hunts.

00:09:26.701 --> 00:09:29.133
[ Laughter ]
He's hanging with celebrities,
kite surfing,

00:09:29.133 --> 00:09:31.100
and having the top button
from all his shirts removed.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.634
[ Laughter and applause ]
When he left --

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:35.234
When he left the White House,
they probably said,

00:09:35.234 --> 00:09:37.567
"Do you want any of these
documents?" And he said --

00:09:37.567 --> 00:09:39.234
[ As Obama ]
Uh...

00:09:39.234 --> 00:09:39.934
[bleep] it.

00:09:39.934 --> 00:09:42.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:42.634 --> 00:09:43.801
You can keep it.

00:09:43.801 --> 00:09:45.701
[ Laughter ]
By the way, we tape this show

00:09:45.701 --> 00:09:47.100
way before it's on TV,

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.834
so, if they find arguments
at Obama's house

00:09:49.834 --> 00:09:51.934
[ Laughter ]
between now and airtime,

00:09:51.934 --> 00:09:54.167
they were planted
by James Corden

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:55.234
to make me look bad.

00:09:55.234 --> 00:09:56.734
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:09:56.734 --> 00:10:01.067
The only other politician
who I can possibly imagine

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:03.267
would have no interest
in taking classified documents

00:10:03.267 --> 00:10:04.434
would be Bernie Sanders.

00:10:04.434 --> 00:10:05.701
[ As Sanders ]
I don't want your documents.

00:10:05.701 --> 00:10:07.567
[ Laughter ]
For too long,

00:10:07.567 --> 00:10:11.267
the top 1% of politicians
has had 99% of the documents.

00:10:11.267 --> 00:10:12.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:12.534 --> 00:10:14.334
We need to redistribute
the documents.

00:10:14.334 --> 00:10:18.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.534
Everyone can have a fair share
of the documents.

00:10:20.534 --> 00:10:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.200
[ Applause ]
Other Trump allies

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.000
reached for distractions,
like Sean Hannity,

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.200
who brushed off the Pence news
and turned his attention

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.100
to someone else --
and you will never guess who.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:33.434
-I think Mike Pence was watching
everything with Biden,

00:10:33.434 --> 00:10:35.801
top secret documents,
et cetera, et cetera.

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:37.934
He initiated
his own investigation,

00:10:37.934 --> 00:10:39.267
just to double-check.

00:10:39.267 --> 00:10:41.033
He immediately called the FBI,

00:10:41.033 --> 00:10:44.100
when they found a couple
of documents, Matt Gaetz,

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:48.200
and handed them over
and worked with the officials.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.801
But that's not the issue, to me.

00:10:49.801 --> 00:10:52.434
The issue is how was
Hillary Clinton treated?

00:10:52.434 --> 00:10:54.868
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God, dude, let it go.

00:10:54.868 --> 00:10:57.200
She already had her
presidential campaign destroyed

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.300
by a never-ending saga
over classified emails

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.234
and, now, she's got to sit
around and watch

00:11:01.234 --> 00:11:04.300
as basically every other living
president or vice president

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.834
opens up a [bleep] cereal box
labeled at home...

00:11:08.667 --> 00:11:09.868
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:11.367
Just get a new thing.

00:11:11.367 --> 00:11:14.267
Find literally anything else
to obsess over.

00:11:14.267 --> 00:11:15.334
Go back to whining about how

00:11:15.334 --> 00:11:17.133
M&amp;M's are too woke now
or something.

00:11:17.133 --> 00:11:19.667
Although, if you ask me,
Mars missed a huge opportunity.

00:11:19.667 --> 00:11:21.534
They shouldn't have canceled
the candy mascots.

00:11:21.534 --> 00:11:23.968
They should've just jumped
on the news and introduced

00:11:23.968 --> 00:11:26.501
a new gray M&amp;M
who steals classified documents.

00:11:26.501 --> 00:11:28.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:28.734 --> 00:11:31.434
Probably the craziest reaction
to the Pence news has come

00:11:31.434 --> 00:11:32.868
from Fox host Tucker Carlson,

00:11:32.868 --> 00:11:34.667
who concocted
an elaborate fantasy

00:11:34.667 --> 00:11:38.167
where the DOJ asked Pence
to look for the documents,

00:11:38.167 --> 00:11:39.400
assuming he had none,

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:42.067
in order to make Trump
look bad by comparison,

00:11:42.067 --> 00:11:44.634
so that they could then
prosecute Trump.

00:11:44.634 --> 00:11:46.634
-It wasn't so long ago
that Pence was on television,

00:11:46.634 --> 00:11:48.767
saying he was sure he had
no classified documents

00:11:48.767 --> 00:11:49.734
in his possession.

00:11:49.734 --> 00:11:51.634
He said that a few times.

00:11:51.634 --> 00:11:54.334
Then, just days ago, Mike Pence
sent his personal attorney

00:11:54.334 --> 00:11:56.334
to search his family's home
in Carmel, Indiana,

00:11:56.334 --> 00:11:57.734
for classified documents.

00:11:58.968 --> 00:12:01.634
Now, if Mike Pence didn't think
he had classified documents,

00:12:01.634 --> 00:12:02.868
why would he send his lawyer

00:12:02.868 --> 00:12:04.868
to go look
for classified documents?

00:12:05.601 --> 00:12:08.334
We can't say for certain,
but it's entirely possible --

00:12:08.334 --> 00:12:09.534
in fact, it's likely --

00:12:09.534 --> 00:12:11.434
that Mike Pence was asked
to do this

00:12:11.434 --> 00:12:13.534
by federal prosecutors
who are trying to build a case

00:12:13.534 --> 00:12:15.901
against his old boss
Donald Trump.

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:18.334
Now, the point would be to show
that not every federal official

00:12:18.334 --> 00:12:20.033
walks off of state secrets.

00:12:20.033 --> 00:12:22.200
Donald Trump was uniquely evil
in that regard,

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.534
as in so many others.

00:12:23.534 --> 00:12:25.033
"See?
Mike Pence didn't do it."

00:12:26.033 --> 00:12:28.868
So, if that was the plan --
and we suspect that it was --

00:12:28.868 --> 00:12:30.901
it backfired spectacularly.

00:12:30.901 --> 00:12:33.000
-[ As Carlson ]
If that was the plan,
what else are they planning?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.834
It's possible --
in fact, it's likely --

00:12:34.834 --> 00:12:36.434
they were planning
on asking Mike Pence

00:12:36.434 --> 00:12:38.167
to go undercover
as Donald Trump.

00:12:38.167 --> 00:12:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:12:39.501 --> 00:12:41.033
And, if that was the plan,
how would they do it?

00:12:41.033 --> 00:12:42.234
Would they have arrested
Donald Trump,

00:12:42.234 --> 00:12:44.200
so they could perform
an experimental surgery,

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.767
wherein they remove
Donald Trump's face

00:12:45.767 --> 00:12:47.667
and swap it with Mike Pence,
just like they did

00:12:47.667 --> 00:12:49.367
to John Travolta
and Nicolas Cage?

00:12:49.367 --> 00:12:51.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
And, if that was the plan,

00:12:51.701 --> 00:12:52.734
then what else
were they planning?

00:12:52.734 --> 00:12:53.767
Would the real Donald Trump,

00:12:53.767 --> 00:12:55.100
now wearing Mike Pence's face,

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:57.167
have escaped, forced to live
his life as Mike Pence?

00:12:57.167 --> 00:12:59.934
And would the real Mike Pence,
now disguised as Donald Trump,

00:12:59.934 --> 00:13:02.067
have to chase him down
and prove his true identity?

00:13:02.067 --> 00:13:04.300
[ Laughter ]
And, if that was the plan --
and we suspect it was...

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.634
[ Laughter ]

00:13:06.634 --> 00:13:09.033
...it backfired spectacularly
because they forgot one thing --

00:13:09.033 --> 00:13:10.767
Mike Pence can catch
Donald Trump

00:13:10.767 --> 00:13:12.133
because Mike Pence

00:13:12.133 --> 00:13:13.133
runs like this.

00:13:13.133 --> 00:13:17.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:17.501 --> 00:13:19.567
In reality, the Biden and Pence
revelations showed

00:13:19.567 --> 00:13:21.868
this is a lot more commonplace
than most of us realized

00:13:21.868 --> 00:13:22.968
and that, if Trump had just

00:13:22.968 --> 00:13:24.634
given the documents back,
when asked,

00:13:24.634 --> 00:13:25.834
there wouldn't
have been a problem.

00:13:25.834 --> 00:13:27.434
Instead, he lied and obstructed
for over a year.

00:13:27.434 --> 00:13:28.868
That's what makes
this case different.

00:13:28.868 --> 00:13:30.567
That, and the fact
that he probably had

00:13:30.567 --> 00:13:32.200
top secret documents stuffed
inside...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.767
-Chick-fil-A bags on the floor.

00:13:33.767 --> 00:13:35.734
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:35.734 --> 00:13:39.467
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

